ever used.","'carouselPple' is assigned a value but never used.","jsx-a11y/img-redundant-alt","Redundant alt attribute. Screen-readers already announce `img` tags as an image. You don’t need to use the words `image`, `photo,` or `picture` (or any specified custom words) in the alt prop.","'InfoModal' is defined but never used.","'hover' is assigned a value but never used.","'setHover' is assigned a value but never used.","'Linkedn' is assigned a value but never used.","'forHireContact' is defined but never used.","'getDetails' is defined but never used.","'editGuarantor' is defined but never used.","'submitGuarantor' is defined but never used.","'isLoading' is assigned a value but never used.","'final_data' is assigned a value but never used.","The true literal is not a valid dependency because it never changes. You can safely remove it.","Literal","'showModal' is assigned a value but never used.","no-dupe-keys","Duplicate key 'phone'.","ObjectExpression",{"desc":"332","fix":"333"},{"desc":"334","fix":"335"},{"desc":"336","fix":"337"},{"desc":"338","fix":"339"},{"desc":"340","fix":"341"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [setShow]",{"range":"342","text":"343"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [props.location.search]",{"range":"344","text":"345"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [fetchTalents]",{"range":"346","text":"347"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [talentId]",{"range":"348","text":"349"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [verify]",{"range":"350","text":"351"},[2555,2557],"[setShow]",[1163,1165],"[props.location.search]",[1007,1009],"[fetchTalents]",[2033,2035],"[talentId]",[667,669],"[verify]"]